meta {
  name: 05 - Respond (chart fallback)
  type: http
  seq: 5
}
post {
  url: {{base_url}}/respond
  body: json
  auth: none
}
headers {
  Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
}
body:json {
  {
    "patient_id": "{{patient_chart_only}}",
    "question": "summarize this patient's chart"
  }
}
docs {
  No documents ingested for this patient, so the supervisor routes to
  chart_reader and answers from structured OpenEMR data instead of refusing.

  Week 2 LAYERS document evidence on top of the chart; it does not replace it.

  Expect: scope=in_scope, verified=true, 2 handoffs (supervisor -> chart_reader).
  Requires OpenEMR to be awake -- free tier, may be slow on first call.
}
